undulate is the name Jasmin works under. Her background is in the scene: club nights, concept events that mix fashion, art, technology and food, listening sessions and festivals. She has done both halves of the work, choosing who plays and making the night run.

That is what she brings to companies. A launch, a summer party or an offsite gets the same care as one of her own nights: a line-up chosen for the room, a bar that works, and artists who are looked after.

[Jasmin: this is where your own story goes. How it started, the first night you put on, and why you called it undulate.]
